DIAGNOSTICS
  E0260: query `nest_lock` joins `LineItem` through `product` with no covering index — the join will scan
  E0315: `for update` on `distinct` query `distinct_lock`
  E0316: `for update` on aggregate query `agg_lock`
  E0317: `for update` on query `nest_lock` projecting a to-many nest
  E0318: `for update` on stream query `stream_lock`
SCHEMA
model Product  table=product
  id: Id
  sku: text  unique
  name: text
  price: int
  items: <- LineItem via product
model LineItem  table=line_item
  id: Id
  product: -> Product  fk=product_id
  qty: int
shape ProductRow from Product
shape SkuCount from Product
shape ProductWithItems from Product
query product_for_update  target=Product verb=get  shape=ProductRow
query products_for_update  target=Product verb=list many  shape=ProductRow
query distinct_lock  target=Product verb=list many  shape=ProductRow
query agg_lock  target=Product verb=list many  shape=SkuCount
query nest_lock  target=Product verb=get  shape=ProductWithItems
query stream_lock  target=Product verb=list many stream  shape=ProductRow
